RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3xMJ8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"83c5523f-5a86-4b6d-a370-d4710cbbf1d4","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"実際、「文法が単純で、設定を気軽にかける式指向の関数型言語がほしいなあ→あれ、それって Elisp じゃね？」と考えたことはあります","ts":"1627631585.025700","edited":{"user":"UL6CFN8NR","ts":"1627631641.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"fukaikousatsu","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"C3v"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c64a68fc-5f08-41e7-a583-013ea97eade9","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"やはりLispに入門しただけだと、で、これで何ができんのってなるのでElispおすすめです","ts":"1627631382.022900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lzG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d3e777aa-2db7-43fa-9893-6cba668adc37","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"lispはちらっと入門して読みづらいってなってやる気が出なかった…","ts":"1627631272.021500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["UL6CFN8NR"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"woLU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"020bfe95-e3b2-4e98-88fa-2036b949a996","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"ただ、普通の中置記法のように自由にカッコはかけないです。というか説明されるより多分Lisp入門したほうが早そう。","ts":"1627631235.021100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tHxyu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9ee6f7fb-c288-4c99-8d74-98610cefdbfe","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"monkeyだと優先順位を考えないと行けなくて、こういうテストケースがあったりして辛かった\n```\t\t{\n\t\t\t\"add(a, b, 1, 2 * 3, 4 + 5, add(6, 7 * 8))\",\n\t\t\t\"add(a, b, 1, (2 * 3), (4 + 5), add(6, (7 * 8)))\",\n\t\t},```","ts":"1627631221.020800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"usw=T"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b268447f-ce06-47ec-b02e-0e37a25b6d6e","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"\u0026gt; 普通の中置記法の演算子のカッコと同じです。カッコが出てきたらそこが優先。\nその理解で居ました","ts":"1627631161.019600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/EwlV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e0ef8ea1-c54e-4151-87cd-05561fd5e594","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"人間が全部指示することになるのでパーサの気持ちになって式を組み立てなくていい","ts":"1627631161.019500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UcGok"}]},{"client_msg_id":"da32c3b2-acaf-4680-9a7f-a3b3c7aebaec","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"括弧があって、前置の演算子になってて、まあ優先度という概念が発生しないという","ts":"1627631160.019400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+P13X"}]},{"client_msg_id":"91525f4b-26fa-410c-8d41-c121051cd453","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"考えなくて良い = ないようなものってのも1つの考え方か","ts":"1627631130.018000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UR9z"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3a3ff942-3d20-4623-87b9-47a9909eed9f","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"普通の中置記法の演算子のカッコと同じです。カッコが出てきたらそこが優先。","ts":"1627631125.017600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Axy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5925e9ec-27d4-4de4-89f5-9fdd9f1dc660","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"S式って優先順位がない、というより優先順位を考えなくて良いって理解ですが合っていますか？","ts":"1627631093.016400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FWka6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fc093add-1891-4291-a4f4-b47cad614382","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"人間が書くように設計されていたのはM式","ts":"1627631053.015600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"p5og"}]},{"client_msg_id":"760dfbb1-2d1f-4c41-81a5-a2188f10d6f4","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"S式のめっちゃ好